WEBVTT

00:00:13.263 --> 00:00:14.431
Göll,

00:00:14.514 --> 00:00:17.684
as the name suggests,
Völundr is the technique

00:00:17.767 --> 00:00:20.603
in which man and Valkyrie become one.

00:00:21.646 --> 00:00:24.482
We do not simply transform
our body into a weapon.

00:00:24.566 --> 00:00:25.984
In other words,

00:00:26.985 --> 00:00:28.361
we share the same fate.

00:00:28.862 --> 00:00:31.406
We fight together and…

00:00:34.325 --> 00:00:36.327
There's no need to cry.

00:00:36.411 --> 00:00:40.832
Reginleif was well aware
of what kind of battle this was.

00:00:41.332 --> 00:00:42.584
Listen.

00:00:42.667 --> 00:00:45.003
When this time comes for you,

00:00:45.086 --> 00:00:47.964
learn from Reginleif
and prepare yourself for your fate.

00:00:49.299 --> 00:00:52.385
Those fucking bastard gods!

00:00:52.969 --> 00:00:56.890
I swear I'll make them pay for this!

00:00:56.973 --> 00:00:57.807
THE THIRD BOUT'S COMBATANT
FOR THE GODS IS POSEIDON

00:00:57.891 --> 00:00:58.892
-Poseidon?
-Poseidon?

00:00:59.476 --> 00:01:02.145
They're not letting up at all.

00:01:02.228 --> 00:01:04.272
I will go.

00:01:04.355 --> 00:01:05.190
When did he show up?

00:01:08.818 --> 00:01:10.153
What's going on here?

00:01:10.236 --> 00:01:14.240
I thought that the souls summoned
to Ragnarok take their strongest form,

00:01:14.324 --> 00:01:18.703
their form during their peak,
regardless of their age at death.

00:01:18.787 --> 00:01:22.332
That's exactly right. So how come you're…

00:01:30.673 --> 00:01:32.217
Got you.

00:01:36.262 --> 00:01:38.681
Indeed, he isn't what I expected.

00:01:39.182 --> 00:01:40.433
However,

00:01:40.517 --> 00:01:44.437
the way he moved just now,
that's the move of a confident master.

00:01:45.230 --> 00:01:47.649
No doubt about it. He's the real thing!

00:01:50.485 --> 00:01:53.988
It has been over 400 years
since I passed on.

00:01:54.072 --> 00:01:57.742
During that time, I have never ceased
honing my swordsmanship.

00:01:58.743 --> 00:02:01.663
My Ganryu's evolution has not yet ended.

00:02:04.582 --> 00:02:09.087
In other words,
this is the golden age of Kojiro!

00:02:13.091 --> 00:02:14.008
Hrist,

00:02:14.884 --> 00:02:16.219
you'll go, won't you?

00:02:18.263 --> 00:02:19.180
Yes.

00:03:51.022 --> 00:03:55.944
TYRANT OF THE OCEAN

00:04:06.287 --> 00:04:08.539
What's with the arena for the third bout?

00:04:09.040 --> 00:04:12.460
Wow. That's one heck of a remodeling job.

00:04:12.543 --> 00:04:14.379
I mean, there's even ocean water.

00:04:14.462 --> 00:04:15.546
Ocean water?

00:04:15.630 --> 00:04:17.382
Does that mean the next guy is…

00:04:17.465 --> 00:04:19.217
Really? Him?

00:04:22.011 --> 00:04:23.721
Ahem.

00:04:23.805 --> 00:04:26.307
Now that mankind has lost twice in a row,

00:04:26.391 --> 00:04:28.810
it's time for the third bout

00:04:28.893 --> 00:04:31.562
in the final battle
between god and man, Ragnarok!

00:04:32.563 --> 00:04:34.482
Why is it

00:04:35.233 --> 00:04:40.488
that the gods burden pitiful mankind
with even more cruel trials?

00:04:41.072 --> 00:04:42.991
But that's what gods are.

00:04:43.074 --> 00:04:44.492
That is the gods!

00:04:44.575 --> 00:04:46.494
That is what the gods are!

00:04:46.577 --> 00:04:50.581
Following the mighty Zeus,
the fighter for the gods is…

00:04:51.749 --> 00:04:54.002
this gentleman!

00:05:20.695 --> 00:05:23.698
While Zeus is the god of the cosmos,

00:05:23.781 --> 00:05:26.284
this gentleman, who controls all the seas,

00:05:26.367 --> 00:05:28.536
is the tyrant of the oceans!

00:05:28.619 --> 00:05:30.538
The ruler of the seas!

00:05:33.124 --> 00:05:34.459
-I knew it!
-I knew it!

00:05:35.877 --> 00:05:39.047
Even the gods fear incurring the wrath

00:05:39.130 --> 00:05:41.049
of the most fearsome god!

00:05:43.134 --> 00:05:45.970
The second of
the three brothers of Olympus,

00:05:46.054 --> 00:05:49.390
also known as Zeus Enalios,
"Zeus of the Ocean."

00:05:49.474 --> 00:05:50.308
His name is…

00:05:52.810 --> 00:05:55.813
Poseidon!

00:06:06.741 --> 00:06:07.909
Such riffraff.

00:06:16.334 --> 00:06:18.586
So it's Poseidon?

00:06:19.128 --> 00:06:22.632
He's even worse at taking a joke
than you are, Dad.

00:06:32.850 --> 00:06:35.019
Even the other gods are frightened.

00:06:35.103 --> 00:06:37.772
Isn't Poseidon Zeus' older brother?

00:06:37.855 --> 00:06:42.443
And the idiotic fool
who will face the fierce god of the sea,

00:06:42.527 --> 00:06:45.822
or rather,
the fighter for mankind is this man!

00:06:49.325 --> 00:06:52.245
Who is the greatest swordsman of all time?

00:06:53.162 --> 00:06:56.082
Is it the demon of Mt. Kurama
who sliced up the Taira clan,

00:06:56.165 --> 00:06:57.875
Minamoto no Yoshitsune?

00:06:58.876 --> 00:07:00.002
Nay!

00:07:00.586 --> 00:07:04.674
Is it the founder of the Shinkage School
who struck fear into Shingen Takeda,

00:07:04.757 --> 00:07:07.426
Nobutsuna Kamiizumi Ise-no-kami?

00:07:08.136 --> 00:07:08.970
Nay!

00:07:10.388 --> 00:07:12.431
Is it the master of the silent sword,

00:07:12.515 --> 00:07:14.934
who the great Shusaku Chiba said
he was no match for,

00:07:15.017 --> 00:07:16.936
Matashiro Takayanagi?

00:07:17.645 --> 00:07:18.479
Nay!

00:07:22.483 --> 00:07:26.612
I would venture that
it is this man who is the greatest!

00:07:29.740 --> 00:07:33.494
How can it be that this "loser"
is the greatest in history?

00:07:36.247 --> 00:07:39.250
Is it due to his ultimate move,
the Tsubame Gaeshi?

00:07:41.085 --> 00:07:45.173
Or is it due to
his desire to get vengeance on Musashi?

00:07:45.756 --> 00:07:46.674
Nay!

00:07:46.757 --> 00:07:47.675
Nay!

00:07:47.758 --> 00:07:48.676
Nay!

00:07:49.177 --> 00:07:53.639
No! That's not why at all!

00:07:54.765 --> 00:07:57.602
Even in defeat, he evolves!

00:07:57.685 --> 00:08:01.981
Even in death, he evolves
step by step to become the greatest!

00:08:02.482 --> 00:08:05.693
Even now, he continues on his road
to becoming the greatest!

00:08:06.527 --> 00:08:09.447
The greatest loser in history!

00:08:12.450 --> 00:08:16.621
SASAKI

00:08:16.704 --> 00:08:20.625
KOJIRO

00:08:20.708 --> 00:08:26.631
KOJIRO SASAKI

00:08:29.217 --> 00:08:32.470
That old geezer is
the next fighter for mankind?

00:08:32.553 --> 00:08:34.555
There's no way he'll win!

00:08:34.639 --> 00:08:36.390
What are they thinking?

00:08:36.474 --> 00:08:39.352
I won't stand for it!
I will never stand for it!

00:08:41.270 --> 00:08:44.524
How come the guy my dad defeated
is the fighter for mankind?

00:08:44.607 --> 00:08:46.442
My father, Musashi Miyamoto,

00:08:46.526 --> 00:08:49.987
is the only one suited to the title of
the greatest swordsman of mankind!

00:08:50.071 --> 00:08:52.073
The Book of Five Rings
penned by my father,

00:08:52.156 --> 00:08:54.951
the holy book of combat,
is the greatest evidence of that!

00:08:56.244 --> 00:08:58.538
Masters, isn't that right?

00:09:00.540 --> 00:09:02.250
I'd say that's right.

00:09:02.333 --> 00:09:05.419
Musashi was the man who defeated even me.

00:09:05.503 --> 00:09:06.754
Indeed.

00:09:06.837 --> 00:09:11.092
However, I would like to hear
Sir Musashi's opinion on the matter.

00:09:11.592 --> 00:09:13.511
MUSASHI MIYAMOTO
FOUNDER OF NITEN ICHI-RYU STYLE

00:09:21.185 --> 00:09:26.107
It looks like
mankind is getting restless, Brünnhilde!

00:09:27.900 --> 00:09:32.905
I trust in his desire to
continuously hone his skills.

00:10:00.057 --> 00:10:01.225
What the heck?

00:10:01.309 --> 00:10:03.227
Who is that man?

00:10:04.103 --> 00:10:05.730
Quite the surprise.

00:10:08.316 --> 00:10:09.650
Well, well.

00:10:09.734 --> 00:10:11.736
It seems as if mankind

00:10:12.361 --> 00:10:15.156
still has some interesting characters.

00:10:17.116 --> 00:10:18.993
The waves have calmed.

00:10:19.076 --> 00:10:21.287
Could it be that old guy's doing?

00:10:22.246 --> 00:10:23.623
Quit being so surprised!

00:10:23.706 --> 00:10:26.626
That's just some dumb deception
by that Sasaki.

00:10:27.126 --> 00:10:28.252
Right, Father?

00:10:34.717 --> 00:10:37.595
Father, why did you slice up
The Book of Five Rings?

00:10:38.095 --> 00:10:40.514
They are no longer needed!

00:10:47.313 --> 00:10:52.068
He has achieved the state
that all sword practitioners strive for.

00:10:52.568 --> 00:10:54.028
The Number One Under the Sun!

00:10:56.113 --> 00:11:00.117
Kojiro Sasaki truly has become
The Number One Under the Sun!

00:11:04.372 --> 00:11:07.124
The third fighter for the gods, Poseidon!

00:11:07.625 --> 00:11:11.128
The third fighter for mankind,
Kojiro Sasaki!

00:11:12.630 --> 00:11:15.049
THE THIRD BOUT IN THE FINAL BATTLE
BETWEEN GOD AND MAN

00:11:15.132 --> 00:11:16.425
Fight!

00:11:36.070 --> 00:11:38.572
The tension is through the roof!

00:11:40.699 --> 00:11:41.909
What's going on?

00:11:41.992 --> 00:11:44.578
How come neither of them is moving?

00:11:52.002 --> 00:11:54.422
If either steps forward,
they're in the other's range.

00:11:54.922 --> 00:11:58.259
It seems they both hope to counterattack
after the other strikes first.

00:11:59.385 --> 00:12:00.386
Pardon me.

00:12:00.886 --> 00:12:04.223
Poseidon isn't hoping for anything at all.

00:12:05.808 --> 00:12:10.229
Poseidon will simply crush any bug
that enters his range.

00:12:10.312 --> 00:12:11.981
That is all.

00:12:38.299 --> 00:12:40.718
He's drenched in sweat
just standing there.

00:12:40.801 --> 00:12:43.053
This guy's never going to win.

00:12:44.763 --> 00:12:47.475
He's exhausted just keeping his distance.

00:12:47.558 --> 00:12:51.061
That Kojiro Sasaki
is as much a loser as he ever was.

00:12:53.397 --> 00:12:55.483
I see. That human

00:12:55.566 --> 00:12:59.069
is devising numerous ways
in which to attack Poseidon.

00:13:00.571 --> 00:13:02.406
In his head, you know.

00:13:03.240 --> 00:13:05.493
What? You didn't notice?

00:13:06.452 --> 00:13:08.037
Oh, his head…

00:13:08.787 --> 00:13:12.791
I knew that right from the start!

00:13:12.875 --> 00:13:15.002
Yes, in his head.

00:13:15.085 --> 00:13:16.212
I knew that!

00:13:16.295 --> 00:13:17.421
I totally knew that!

00:13:21.759 --> 00:13:23.427
That's no good either.

00:13:25.304 --> 00:13:28.974
No one knew that in the brief moments
since the bout started,

00:13:29.058 --> 00:13:33.062
Kojiro Sasaki had
already been killed 18 times.

00:13:34.647 --> 00:13:36.065
Dammit.

00:13:37.274 --> 00:13:40.778
No matter how I attack him, I die.

00:13:47.284 --> 00:13:50.454
Poseidon is far too powerful.

00:13:50.538 --> 00:13:53.040
Yes. I wonder if there is even a way.

00:13:57.086 --> 00:13:59.922
Kojiro is already
growing wary of attacking.

00:14:00.005 --> 00:14:04.468
That Poseidon truly is the most fearsome
of the 12 gods of Olympus.

00:14:05.344 --> 00:14:07.972
"The 12 gods," you say?

00:14:09.765 --> 00:14:13.769
This is a good chance
for me to tell you about this, Göll.

00:14:13.852 --> 00:14:15.479
About what?

00:14:16.188 --> 00:14:18.983
Originally, like us Valkyrie,

00:14:19.066 --> 00:14:23.404
there were 13 gods in Olympus.

00:14:23.487 --> 00:14:27.241
What? There were 13 gods? What happened?

00:14:28.784 --> 00:14:32.496
One of the 13 gods of Olympus…

00:14:33.539 --> 00:14:36.250
was killed by Poseidon.

00:14:37.668 --> 00:14:42.214
You're kidding! A god killed a god?

00:14:42.298 --> 00:14:45.718
I've never heard of that! Who was killed?

00:14:46.635 --> 00:14:48.220
The name of that god was…

00:14:49.305 --> 00:14:50.723
Adamas.

00:14:50.806 --> 00:14:53.058
What? Adamas?

00:14:53.142 --> 00:14:56.562
Isn't that Zeus' final form?

00:14:56.645 --> 00:15:01.901
No. It was one of the gods
born of the ruler of the cosmos, Cronus.

00:15:03.569 --> 00:15:06.572
It is the name of the older brother
of Zeus and Poseidon.

00:15:07.072 --> 00:15:09.241
Adamas.

00:15:12.286 --> 00:15:13.954
In time immemorial…

00:15:23.005 --> 00:15:26.258
That brat is the greatest god?

00:15:27.259 --> 00:15:28.928
He's the youngest son!

00:15:30.012 --> 00:15:33.432
I won't stand for it!
This is totally unacceptable!

00:15:34.767 --> 00:15:40.105
After Zeus and the other gods of Olympus
overthrew the Titans at Titanomachy,

00:15:40.606 --> 00:15:44.610
upset that the youngest son inherited
the position of the greatest god,

00:15:46.278 --> 00:15:49.448
the second eldest son, Adamas, rebelled.

00:15:50.032 --> 00:15:55.454
He freed the Titans and the Gigantes
who had been imprisoned in Tartarus,

00:15:55.537 --> 00:15:59.625
bent the most terrifying beast
in heaven, Typhon, to his will,

00:15:59.708 --> 00:16:02.044
and marched forth with his army.

00:16:02.544 --> 00:16:03.963
POSEIDON'S PALACE

00:16:04.046 --> 00:16:05.464
The time has come!

00:16:06.048 --> 00:16:07.633
Already, the gods of heaven,

00:16:07.716 --> 00:16:11.470
the 49 gods who backed Zeus,
are on my side!

00:16:12.054 --> 00:16:13.138
And that's not all!

00:16:13.222 --> 00:16:16.558
Several of the 13 gods of Olympus,
including Hermes,

00:16:16.642 --> 00:16:18.978
have promised to switch to my side!

00:16:19.061 --> 00:16:20.729
Now there's just you, Poseidon!

00:16:20.813 --> 00:16:25.484
If you ally yourself with me,
we'll have Zeus' neck.

00:16:28.696 --> 00:16:31.699
No older brother serves
his younger siblings.

00:16:32.366 --> 00:16:34.368
Isn't that right?

00:16:34.952 --> 00:16:40.708
You'll assist me, your older brother,
won't you, Poseidon?

00:16:43.252 --> 00:16:46.005
What a pathetic older brother you are.

00:16:55.514 --> 00:17:00.019
Sorry, but you're a little
far away, Poseidon.

00:17:00.519 --> 00:17:03.605
What the fuck did you just say?

00:17:12.114 --> 00:17:13.949
What did you say?

00:17:15.367 --> 00:17:17.953
I may have misheard you.

00:17:19.413 --> 00:17:20.456
Say it clearly…

00:17:21.498 --> 00:17:23.167
one more time.

00:17:27.296 --> 00:17:30.591
As if Zeus wasn't bad enough.
You're the same, dammit!

00:17:31.175 --> 00:17:34.511
You little pricks think nothing of me,
your older brother!

00:17:36.680 --> 00:17:38.348
Look me in the eye!

00:17:38.432 --> 00:17:41.935
I am your older brother!
Show me some fucking respect!

00:17:47.691 --> 00:17:49.109
Gods don't gather armies.

00:17:51.028 --> 00:17:52.696
Gods don't plot schemes.

00:17:53.197 --> 00:17:54.865
Gods don't rely on one another.

00:17:56.700 --> 00:17:58.202
That is what gods are.

00:17:59.995 --> 00:18:02.748
We are perfect beings from the very start.

00:18:04.333 --> 00:18:08.003
However,
you have defiled all those things.

00:18:08.712 --> 00:18:10.172
You fucking bastard!

00:18:13.550 --> 00:18:15.969
How dare you ridicule me,
your older brother!

00:18:21.892 --> 00:18:22.810
Don't…

00:18:25.145 --> 00:18:27.648
Don't belittle me!

00:18:31.276 --> 00:18:33.112
Always…

00:18:33.195 --> 00:18:35.781
He's always been like that!

00:18:37.324 --> 00:18:38.158
Not once…

00:18:39.701 --> 00:18:40.869
Never…

00:18:42.830 --> 00:18:47.251
Not a single time
did he ever look me in the eye!

00:18:50.838 --> 00:18:53.841
Look me in the eye!

00:18:59.012 --> 00:19:00.514
The one moment in his entire life

00:19:01.265 --> 00:19:04.101
when Poseidon looked him in the eye,

00:19:06.520 --> 00:19:08.856
his life ended.

00:19:10.774 --> 00:19:13.277
Posei…

00:19:34.923 --> 00:19:40.012
There was one who wasn't a god
among the 13 gods of Olympus.

00:19:40.095 --> 00:19:42.347
Isn't that right, Hermes?

00:19:45.601 --> 00:19:46.935
I guess he spotted me.

00:19:52.482 --> 00:19:53.317
Indeed.

00:19:55.110 --> 00:19:59.031
After that day,
the history of the gods was rewritten

00:19:59.698 --> 00:20:04.369
so that there were originally
only 12 gods of Olympus ever.

00:20:06.246 --> 00:20:10.083
I remember that now.
When that Adamas rebelled,

00:20:10.167 --> 00:20:15.422
there were rumors
that one of us 12 was a traitor.

00:20:15.505 --> 00:20:17.257
That was me.

00:20:21.386 --> 00:20:24.056
What? Are you insane?

00:20:24.139 --> 00:20:27.309
There could have been a fight
that split the heavens!

00:20:27.392 --> 00:20:30.062
I thought
that would be rather interesting.

00:20:32.648 --> 00:20:33.982
Yes! Let's do it!

00:20:34.066 --> 00:20:35.108
War!

00:20:35.192 --> 00:20:36.818
Let's have a war!

00:20:37.319 --> 00:20:39.404
War!

00:20:40.948 --> 00:20:43.951
Zeus was also looking forward to it.

00:20:44.910 --> 00:20:46.411
Unbelievable.

00:20:46.912 --> 00:20:48.622
I'll never understand you.

00:20:49.289 --> 00:20:52.918
You know, it's hard to believe
that mighty warrior, Adamas,

00:20:53.001 --> 00:20:54.586
was slain with a single strike.

00:20:54.670 --> 00:20:58.590
That's not what makes Poseidon
so terrifying.

00:21:00.676 --> 00:21:04.596
When Poseidon said
Adamas never even existed,

00:21:05.430 --> 00:21:08.767
that is how it became so.

00:21:11.812 --> 00:21:15.941
Nobody objected.
No objections would be allowed.

00:21:17.317 --> 00:21:20.153
That is what makes him terrifying.

00:21:21.280 --> 00:21:22.864
Yes, you're right.

00:21:22.948 --> 00:21:24.992
That is why he is

00:21:25.075 --> 00:21:28.245
more godlike than any of the rest of us.

00:21:38.380 --> 00:21:41.550
It seems this god doesn't even look at me.

00:21:42.217 --> 00:21:45.345
Well then, what to do?

00:21:45.846 --> 00:21:46.972
What?

00:21:52.769 --> 00:21:55.272
Okay now…

00:22:01.111 --> 00:22:03.697
I sure don't want to die.

00:23:29.950 --> 00:23:34.955
Subtitle translation by: Brian Athey
